            "[\"First, drag PersonX's sorry limbs from LocationY and toss 'em into LocationZ. Simple. Second, thing or no thing, ThingX gets dump in LocationY. Preferably somewhere out of sight. Third...well, added or removed, ThingX better not be crawling around in LocationZ any longer. A nice clean snatch outta that damned spot. Execution is what we need here, not patience.\", \"Movement's a tricky thing. But let's get it done.\\n\\nStep 1: PersonX; lifted from LocationY like some inconsequential object. Dropped in LocationZ. Doesn't matter what he wants, what he needs. The job's the job.\\n\\nStep 2: LocationY got emptier. Needs to be filled again. ThingX's turn to be thrown around like it doesn't matter. No conscience in the task. Just the cold, hard facts.\\n\\nStep 3: LocationZ. Now it's too crowded. ThingX got to go. Feels like a waste of time, moving things back and forth. But time's all we got. Damn these nonsense tasks. It's all the machinations of a corrupt system.\", 'V.0.) Task at hand, clear. First, shift \"PersonX\" out of \"LocationY\", place them in \"LocationZ\". Done, like rook-moves on chess board.    Second, \"ThingX\" enters picture. Place \"ThingX\" in \"LocationY\", fill the void left by \"PersonX\". Steady, no rush. Lastly, locate \"ThingX\" at \"LocationZ\", remove it. The ballet of objective complete. But as always, consequences linger, hidden, like shadow\\'s promise in early dawn.', \"Following the instructions to their barest essentials. Like pieces on a board. That'd be how it'd go:\\n\\nFirst thing's first, move goody two-shoes, PersonX, hauling from the wasteland we call LocationY to this fresh hell hole, LocationZ. Easy.\\n\\nNext, bring in our guest of honor, ThingX, settle it comfortably in the nightmare couch of LocationY. \\n\\nFinally, the last round. ThingX seems to have overstayed its welcome in LocationZ. Time to take out the trash.\\n\\nGame over. Next.\", 'Fine. Step1: Drag PersonX, kicking and screaming if need be, out of the gutters of LocationY. Dump them, unceremoniously, in the barren wasteland of LocationZ. Step2: Infest LocationY with ThingX. Let it seep into cracks, leave its mark. Step3: Wrestle ThingX out of LocationZ. Rip it from the place, leave nothing behind. Just deeds, remembered no more.']"
